      "value": "@{5a50e303ae715b48f1d1fbe9|full_name}: This isn't that easy, sign language translation is still an unsolved research problem, I haven't seen a system that is able to read sign language and mechanically translate it.\nIf you find one, let me know :D",
      "viewerReactions": null
